#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:115
msgid ""
"The base cost of the resource(s). The Price will match the Cost unless a "
"Price Adjustment is added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:117
msgid "Price Adjustment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:118
msgid "**None:** Default, no markup added and Price will match Cost"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:119
msgid ""
"**Fixed Markup:** A fixed amount added to the Cost. Price will equal Cost"
" + Markup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:120
msgid ""
"**Percentage Markup:** Adds a percentage markup to Cost. Price equals "
"`Cost + (Cost x Markup %)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:121
msgid ""
"**Custom Price:** Sets a Price independent from the Cost. If the Cost "
"changes, a Custom Price will not."
msgstr ""

